# Google Custom Search API — powers the startup & funding discovery feed on the Jobs page.
# Without these, that section falls back to sample data.
#
# 1. Create an API key: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials (enable "Custom Search API")
# 2. Create a Programmable Search Engine (search the whole web): https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/
#    -> copy its Search engine ID
GOOGLE_CSE_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_CSE_CX=
